{"id":"640890","name":"玉米面馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/640890/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"低粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"50克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"温水","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"低粉，温水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/640890/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入玉米面，酵母粉。","img":"images/640890/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入两个鸡蛋。","img":"images/640890/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成光滑面团，放入不锈钢碗里。","img":"images/640890/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖锅盖，发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/640890/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分成小剂子，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/640890/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖锅盖，发酵至两倍大。大火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/640890/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"焖五分钟，取出来。","img":"images/640890/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"早餐，成品。配一碗粥。","img":"images/640890/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品，家常馒头配白粥。","img":"images/640890/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}